  ],
  "description": "CreateDatabase(path, dbLangGeneral, dbVersion120); One(ID LONG primary key) with one row. For each length n in [2147483647 ;; 2147483646 ;; 2147483645 ;; 2147483640 ;; 1073741824 ;; 1073741823 ;; 536870912 ;; 268435456 ;; 65536 ;; 65535 ;; 32768 ;; 32767 ;; 4 ;; 0 ;; -1 ;; 2147483648 ;; CLng(2147483647) ;; 2147483647.4]: SELECT Left('abcd', n) FROM One as a snapshot, the value read; then the same for [Right('abcd', 2147483647) ;; Right('abcd', 1073741823) ;; Right('abcd', 65536) ;; Mid('abcd', 2, 2147483647) ;; Mid('abcd', 2, 1073741823) ;; Mid('abcd', 2, 2147483646) ;; Mid('abcd', 2147483647) ;; Mid('abcd', 2147483647, 1) ;; Left$('abcd', 2147483647) ;; LeftB('abcd', 2147483647) ;; Left('', 2147483647) ;; Left(Null, 2147483647)]. Finds where ACE begins to refuse a length (r-expr-1b/str-mid-left-right-edges #290: 2147483647 fails 5 at open) and whether Right, Mid and the $ and B forms share the bound.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
